<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Resurrection</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 40)
Mana: 80
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast resurrection &lt;player&gt;
</pre>
<p>The great prayer of life: it pulls a dead player's soul out of Valhalla and 
back into their body, whole. Like raise dead, it only works in the short time 
after their death while their spirit is still in Valhalla (see <a cmd='#'>Help Die</a>), 
and only if you have their corpse: lying in the room with you, or carried.
</p><p>Unlike raise dead, the player stands up with full hit points, mana and 
endurance, and nobody loses experience. They arrive where you are, with 
everything the corpse held.
</p><p>A corpse whose head was cut off can't be resurrected without its head: carry 
the head, and the spell takes it. The prayer leaves you queasy: you must wait 
about two and a half minutes before you can cast it again, a little less the 
stronger your spell. You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Raise Dead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Die</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Decapitate</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>